{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790527630439,"sessionID":"ses_f1c5a4875ffeR5KO5Iu7pV8EKt","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call-c840a175-4934-474f-a13f-7b7bba611bed","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"subagent_type":"explore","description":"Explore codebase structure","prompt":"Explore the /workspace directory structure. I need to understand:\n1. The overall directory layout\n2. Where the bot's strategy code lives (autoascend/ package)\n3. The content of /refs/ folder, especially CONTEXT.md, parent-eval.json, and attempts.md\n4. How the bot currently makes decisions (the act() function, strategy, etc.)\n\nReturn:\n- The directory tree (top 2-3 levels)\n- The full content of /refs/CONTEXT.md\n- The full content of /refs/parent-eval.json (or at least key parts showing scores per seed/identity)\n- The full content of /refs/attempts.md\n- The main strategy file(s) in autoascend/ package and their contents\n- The arena_adapter.py file contents"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f1c5899deffe6WYSwGgx2fUkwF\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Workspace Directory Structure (top 3 levels)\n\n```\n/workspace\n├── .git/\n├── arena_adapter.py        # Arena adapter bridging AutoAscend + NLE\n├── bot.py                  # Bot entry point (makes ArenaBot)\n├── LICENSE\n├── nethackers.solution.json  # Solution metadata\n└── autoascend/             # Main AutoAscend package\n   ├── __init__.py\n   ├── agent.py             # Core Agent class (2100+ lines) - decision making\n   ├── strategy.py          # Strategy pattern framework\n   ├── global_logic.py     # Global logic & milestone progression\n   ├── character.py        # Character parsing & properties\n   ├── exploration_logic.py # Level exploration\n   ├── combat/             # Fight heuristics\n   ├── item/               # Inventory management\n   ├── level.py            # Level representation\n   ├── monster_tracker/    # Monster tracking\n   ├── glyph/              # Glyph/Symbol constants\n   ├── objects/            # Object definitions\n   ├── soko_solver/        # Sokoban solver\n   ├── stats_logger.py\n   └── utils.py\n```\n\n---\n\n## 1. /refs/ Folder\n\n**The `/refs/` directory does not exist** in the workspace. The requested files (CONTEXT.md, parent-eval.json, attempts.md) are not present.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Bot Decision-Making Flow\n\nThe bot's decision pipeline flows through these key components:\n\n### `bot.py` → `ArenaBot` → `Bot` → `AutoAscendDriver`\n\n- `Bot.act(observation)` calls `self._driver.act(observation)`\n- `AutoAscendDriver.act()` either returns a queued action from the AutoAscend agent thread, or a fallback ESC action\n\n### `arena_adapter.py` - The Adapter\n\n- `AutoAscendDriver` maintains a thread that runs `autoascend.agent.Agent.main()`\n- `act()` retrieves the next action from the agent via `next_action_index(timeout)`\n- If the agent thread errors or times out, it falls back to `A.Command.ESC` (value 0)\n\n### `autoascend/agent.py` - Core Agent\n\n- `Agent.main()` runs an infinite loop:\n  1. Initialization: step ESC×2, parse attributes, enable autopickup\n  2. Main loop: alternates between `on_panic()` steps and `global_logic.global_strategy().run()`\n  3. On cyclic panics (300+ turns), raises RuntimeError\n\n### `autoascend/global_logic.py` - Strategy Orchestration\n\n- `GlobalLogic.global_strategy()` chains strategies via `.preempt()`:\n  1. `current_strategy().repeat()` - the top-level milestone strategy\n  2. Preemptive layers: sokoban, offer corpses, wait unexpected state, cure disease, eat, follow guard, anger dwarves, fight2, engulfed, sleep, magic mapping, dig_down\n- `current_strategy()` milestone-based progression:\n  - `BE_ON_FIRST_LEVEL` → grind to XL → descend\n  - `FIND_GNOMISH_MINES` → find mines\n  - `FIND_SOKOBAN` → solve sokoban\n  - `FIND_MINETOWN` → find minetown\n  - `SOLVE_SOKOBAN` → solve sokoban\n  - `FIND_MINES_END` → find mines' end\n  - `GO_DOWN` → dig down to deeper levels\n\n### `autoascend/strategy.py` - Strategy Pattern\n\n- `Strategy.wrap()` decorates generator functions\n- `Strategy.run()` executes the strategy generator\n- `Strategy.check_condition()` checks the yield condition\n- Key methods: `condition()`, `until()`, `before()`, `preempt()`, `repeat()`, `every()`\n\n### Decision Example Flow\n\n1. Agent starts → `global_strategy()` runs\n2. `current_strategy()` determines current milestone\n3. Based on milestone, enters appropriate sub-strategy (grind, mines, sokoban, etc.)\n4. Sub-strategies yield conditions; when condition is True, actions are performed\n5. Actions include: move, attack, zap, pray, dig, search, etc.\n6. `fight2()` (in agent.py line 1167) uses combat heuristics to decide between melee, ranged, spell, or wait\n7. `emergency_strategy()` handles healing, prayer, wand of sleep as fallback\n\n### Key Decision Points\n\n| Area | File | Function |\n|------|------|----------|\n| High-level strategy | `global_logic.py` | `global_strategy()`, `current_strategy()` |\n| Combat actions | `agent.py` | `fight2()`, `emergency_strategy()` |\n| Spellcasting | `agent.py` | `cast()`, `should_cast_heal()` |\n| Item management | `agent.py` | `eat_corpses_from_ground()`, `eat_from_inventory()` |\n| Exploration | `exploration_logic.py` | `explore1()`, `go_to_level_strategy()` |\n| Strategy framework | `strategy.py` | `Strategy.wrap`, `preempt`, `condition` |\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f1c5a4875ffeR5KO5Iu7pV8EKt","sessionId":"ses_f1c5899deffe6WYSwGgx2fUkwF","model":{"modelID":"nemotron-3.5-lightning-free","providerID":"opencode"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore codebase structure","time":{"start":1790525793830,"end":1790527630428}},"id":"prt_0e3a76616001x785C0JwX6MM6D","sessionID":"ses_f1c5a4875ffeR5KO5Iu7pV8EKt","messageID":"msg_0e3a5ba280011ogWG0CMMGZY11"}}
