{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790527678951,"sessionID":"ses_f1c5a4875ffeR5KO5Iu7pV8EKt","part":{"id":"prt_0e3c40e06001atFHmpF0P28PWx","messageID":"msg_0e3c3dee2001wyou24a9EFSCuO","sessionID":"ses_f1c5a4875ffeR5KO5Iu7pV8EKt","type":"reasoning","text":"Now I have a good understanding of the codebase. Let me analyze the key issues from the per-seed data:\n\nThe bot `hea-gno-neu-mal` scores mean 0.091 across 15 seeds. Looking at the deaths:\n\n- Seed 8: 0.554 - best performance, reached Dlvl:27, killed by giant eel\n- Seed 0: 0.117 - Xp:9, killed by gargoyle\n- Seed 4: 0.117 - Xp:9, killed by soldier ant\n- Seed 7: 0.126 - Dlvl:10, killed by bolt of lightning\n- Seed 10: 0.098 - Dlvl:9, killed by owlbear\n- Seed 1: 0.075 - Xp:8, killed by Woodland-elf\n- Seed 11: 0.051 - Xp:7, killed by rothe\n- Seed 6: 0.029 - Xp:5, killed by dwarf zombie\n- Seed 3: 0.037 - Xp:6, killed by cave spider\n- Seed 9: 0.037 - Xp:6, killed by wererat\n- Seed 5: 0.021 - Xp:3, killed by brown mold\n- Seed 12: 0.024 - Xp:4, killed by hobbit\n- Seed 13: 0.037 - Xp:6, killed by little dog\n- Seed 2: 0.024 - Xp:4, died of starvation\n- Seed 14: 0.021 - Xp:3, killed by hobbit\n\nMajor issues:\n1. **Starvation** - seeds 2, 12, 14 die early (Xp:3-4)\n2. **Early monster deaths** - many seeds die to weak monsters early\n3. **Lightning** - seed 7 dies to bolt of lightning at Dlvl:10\n4. **No consistent pick-axe diving** - only seed 8 gets deep\n\nThe key observation: Only seed 8 gets deep (Dlvl:27). The rest stall at Xp:3-9 on Dlvl 1-2. The starving deaths (seeds 2, 12, 14) are particularly concerning - they die early from lack of food.\n\nLet me look at the combat and exploration logic to understand what's happening.\n\nA key hypothesis: The bot needs better early-game survival - specifically better food management, better early combat, and possibly earlier diving to get out of Dlvl 1 where food is scarce.\n\nLet me look at the combat and exploration logic.","time":{"start":1790527671814,"end":1790527678944}}}
