()` returns `ROLE_GRIND_XL.get(character.role, GRIND_XL)` which defaults to 8 for healer.\n\nFor `hea-gno-neu-mal`: role=HEALER (3), race=NEU (1), alignment=MAL (2).\n\nLooking at `ROLES_LEAVING_GRIND_WHEN_HUNGRY`: Healers are NOT in this set. So `LEAVE_GRIND_WHEN_HUNGRY` won't cause Healers to leave when hungry.\n\nSo for a Healer, the bot grinds to Xp 8 on Dlvl 1 before moving on. But the bot starts with limited food and may starve before reaching Xp 8.\n\nLet me check what the Healer starts with and how the early game goes.\n\nActually, let me focus on a specific hypothesis. The key improvement I can make is:\n\n**Hypothesis: The bot dies early because it doesn't engrave Elbereth early enough, and it doesn't manage food well on Dlvl 1.**\n\nBut wait - the code does have elbereth_action in fight2, and the global_logic has offer_corpses and other strategies. Let me think about what's actually going wrong.\n\nActually, let me re-read the problem more carefully. The user says the bot currently scores 0.091. I need to make ONE focused change that raises its score.\n\nLet me look at what changes were tried in the `parent/` folder (the original workspace copy):","time":{"start":1790528164720,"end":1790528364270}}}
